  "locales": {
    "en": {
      "trackName": "Space Impact Watch",
      "description": "THE LEGENDARY RETRO SHOOTER - ON YOUR WRIST, AND NOW ON IPHONE & IPAD!\n\nRemember gaming under the school desk on those bulky, indestructible old phones? Relive those moments - under the office desk, on your watch. And now also on your iPhone and iPad!\n\nDive into the Space Impact world exactly as you remember it - with plenty of modern upgrades:\n\n- All eight old-school levels with bosses, exactly as you remember them. Put that muscle memory to good use.\n- Crisp, sharp graphics with the original retro sprites - without the ghosting of the old 84x48 displays. You can finally see what's happening on that tiny screen.\n- NEW: fully playable on iPhone and iPad.\n- Adjustable controls: gestures and the Digital Crown on the watch, on-screen buttons on iPhone and iPad.\n- Three special weapons - deeply satisfying to fire.\n- Worldwide Game Center leaderboard. Can you make the TOP 100?\n- Infinite mode: finished all the levels and want more? Blast alien invaders for as long as your skills hold out.\n- Butter-smooth movement and animations.\n\nSpace awaits - on your wrist!",
      "releaseNotes": "The game has broken free of the watch - Space Impact is now fully playable on iPhone and iPad!\n\n- Hold to move, hold to fire, tap to launch the nuke\n- Classic Nokia layout: the 84x48 game screen on top, keypad below\n- All eight story levels plus infinite mode\n- Haptic feedback that channels the old vibration motor\n- Minor fixes and performance improvements",
      "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/us/app/space-impact-watch/id1550604563?uo=4",
